{"Article": "01:15:01", "Agency": "", "Status": "", "RuleId": 45, "RuleNumber": "01:15:01", "Type": "C", "Catchline": "DEFINITIONS", "Path": "01/15/01/", "Filename": "0115010000000C.htm", "Title": 1, "Parents": [{"DisplayRuleNumber": "01:15", "RuleNumber": "01:15"}, {"DisplayRuleNumber": "01", "RuleNumber": "01:15:01"}], "Html": "<div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<title>Rule 01:15:01 DEFINITIONS</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 01:15:01\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 01:15:01 DEFINITIONS\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p align=center><b>CHAPTER 1:15:01</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=center><b>DEFINITIONS</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Section</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"DisplayRule.aspx?Rule=01:15:01:01\">1:15:01:01</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Meaning of\r\nterms.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div><br /><hr><br /><div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 01:15:01:01 Meaning of terms.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 01:15:01:01\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 01:15:01:01 Meaning of terms.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>1:15:01:01.&nbsp;&nbsp;Meaning of terms.</b> The terms used in this\r\narticle mean:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;Board,&quot; the\r\nrural development telecommunications network board of directors;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;Director,&quot;\r\nthe executive director of the office of rural development telecommunications\r\nnetwork;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (3)&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;Network,&quot;\r\nthe system of phone lines and satellite equipment used by the rural development\r\ntelecommunications network;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (4)&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;RDTN,&quot; the office of rural development\r\ntelecommunications network.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b>\r\n19 SDR 85, effective December 15, 1992.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General\r\nAuthority:</b>SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=1-33-36\">1-33-36.</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law\r\nImplemented:</b>SDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=1-33-36\">1-33-36.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div>", "Archived": [], "Next": "01:15:01:01", "Previous": "01:15"}